          <p><strong>Address:</strong> Level 24, 15 Blue Street, North Sydney NSW 2060</p>
          <p><strong>Note:</strong> Embassy moved to Sydney in 2021. Check official website for current location.</p>
          <p><strong>Service:</strong> All NLV visa applications and processing. Email visa enquiries to the consulate.</p>
          <p><strong>Processing time:</strong> 2–4 months after submission of complete dossier.</p>
