        <p>Spain requires a clean criminal record as part of NLV approval. The Australian Federal Police (AFP) National Police Check is the official document you'll submit. See our full <a href="/non-lucrative-visa-documents/">NLV documents checklist</a> for everything you need alongside the AFP check.</p>
